[script:bablo-pettycr] [UPDATE AVAILABLE] bablo-pettycrimes
[script:bablo-pettycr] --------------------------------------------------
[script:bablo-pettycr] Current Version: 2.0.5
[script:bablo-pettycr] New Version:     2.1.0
[script:bablo-pettycr] 
[script:bablo-pettycr] Patch Notes:
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Added custom locations for Store Shelves — shelves that are part of the
[script:bablo-pettycr]     map (not props) can now be searched too. In the editor go to Store Shelves
[script:bablo-pettycr]     → Locations, stand facing the shelf and press Add My Position (or paste
[script:bablo-pettycr]     coords like x, y, z / vector3(...)).
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • You can now set the size of the Store Shelves search spot. Changes apply as
[script:bablo-pettycr]     soon as you save, no restart needed. Works with ox_target, qb-target and
[script:bablo-pettycr]     standalone.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Mailboxes: the robbery animation now plays every time, not just on the
[script:bablo-pettycr]     first attempt.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Mailboxes: failing the lockpick now ends the attempt. Before, it trapped
[script:bablo-pettycr]     you in the 'stuck' minigame until you won it.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Mailboxes: getting stuck now only happens after a successful robbery (Stuck
[script:bablo-pettycr]     Chance), and you get at most 5 tries to break free.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Mailboxes: opening a letter can no longer give you another letter.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • When updating: if you use your own edited target file (src/targets/*.lua),
[script:bablo-pettycr]     copy the new addSphereZone and removeZone functions into it or Store
[script:bablo-pettycr]     Shelves locations won't show. Everything else keeps working without them.
[script:bablo-pettycr]   • Restart the resource; your editor settings carry over.
[script:bablo-pettycr] 
[script:bablo-pettycr] Download: portal.cfx.re/assets/granted-assets
